Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Never-Opening Cell's been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know what's in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I believe it was chained up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not being able to escape,\Nit must've died inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How sweet and rich the smell is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And there is so much of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.53,0:03:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was worth coming all the way here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The red-bean soup was so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.89,0:03:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw hat man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...who ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"Stop the Emperor of the Sea!\NQueen's Secret Plan!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you eat it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn! I won't let him die!\NI'm not gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come off! Come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it! That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come off!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.89,0:05:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The collars came off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did I do?! Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I can't believe it...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.11,0:05:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That was...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You got away again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Alright! Let's run, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw hat man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before you forget that feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A moment of crisis will \Nreveal your true power!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let you get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Practice now?! Are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I fail, you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.70,0:06:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bring it on! Emperor of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.37,0:06:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do what Rayleigh did back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to remove your collar now.\NAre you ready, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on, old man!\NDon't be crazy! It'll explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've seen a slave's collar explode before!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a bad idea! A very bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:06:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure about this, Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be all right. Just stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm telling you, it's too dangerous!\NIt won't come off without the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's ringing! What're we gonna do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.91,0:07:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He took the collar off barehanded?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was exactly the same as\Nwhat Rayleigh did back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That thing that I just did!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even with two years of training,\NI never came close to mastering it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that was Ryuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I was so desperate.\NI don't remember how I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't get away now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Straw hat man...\NThe Ryuo technique you just showed...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...was superior to\Nwhat I can teach you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}So I'm sure you can stop her!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Slam the monstrous woman's fist,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and save our lives!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I know you can do it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Let's see what you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.69,0:08:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You might die, you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.53,0:08:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he trying to catch it?!\NHow reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:08:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Luffy can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Instead of straining myself,\NI should allow Haki to flow to my fists!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.17,0:09:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.39,0:09:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffytaro-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So predictable!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, old man! I failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, old man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I used Ryuo to shield just in case...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.37,0:10:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All I can teach you is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.80,0:10:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...the Ryuo technique\Nthat covers the outside of your body...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.11,0:10:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what you call Haki...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.94,0:10:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haki is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:11:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...a very strong power that defends you like invisible armor\Nand can also be used offensively.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if you take it up a notch,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.55,0:11:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,the Haki that covers you\Nwill become even stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and it will enter your enemy's body\Nand destroy it from the inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Earlier, those steel collars...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...were destroyed from the inside\Nusing your Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've already got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've already acquired the Haki\Nthat covers your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You just don't realize it yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Believe in your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Don't die on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He finally dropped dead?!\NHyogoro the Flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay with me! Old man! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.53,0:12:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, old man! Don't die on me! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't die on me, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.99,0:13:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Stay with me! Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Don't die on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you eat the red-bean soup\Nthat was for me and everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck! Straw hat man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're alive! Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You got away again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:14:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tsk! He's alive! That damn Hyogoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.43,0:14:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn! Give up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.91,0:14:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.29,0:14:24.36,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,IRON 02
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:29.68,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,PRISON IRONWORKS, UDON
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I can't make contact!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that the Boss Snail disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.31,0:14:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why's the earth rumbling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,B-Big Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.72,0:15:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let you get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All hell broke loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.41,0:15:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's that young guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.45,0:16:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The furnace in the Prison \NIronworks has blown up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.76,0:16:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What can we do?!\NBig Mom is an Emperor of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0} was no match for her...\NWe have no chance of stopping her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.60,0:16:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Q-Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Land of Wano is Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0}'s territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let that old bag \Ndo whatever she wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's only one chance.\NListen carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't get away from me, brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You see, Big Mom is like a wild boar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.88,0:17:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'll charge forward going around Udon,\Nand loop back around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So set a trap here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.26,0:17:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get rid of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.03,0:17:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We must stop Olin-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! We can't compete against her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave her to Luffytaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.96,0:18:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What an interesting kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He singlehandedly turned \Naround a terrible situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.82,0:18:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can get out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep going! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:40.01,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,RED-BEAN SOUP
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep going! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:00.07,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,RED-BEAN SOUP
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}! We're good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}! She's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn! She's so persistent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Red-bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! She fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ya-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You ate it all again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! I didn't eat that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Brachio...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay! Bull's eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurrah for Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.58,0:20:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's our Queen-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He saved the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Olin-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Mama!\N--Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Mama!\N--Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.74,0:21:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My sweet babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:21:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.00,0:22:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Mama!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.69,0:22:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.91,0:22:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now I remember everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.60,0:23:22.38,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Brutal ammunition made by Queen, the Plague Rounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.38,0:23:25.15,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,dash all hope in the Excavation Labor Camp!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.15,0:23:26.57,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Getting shot means death!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.57,0:23:30.86,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,The dreadful weapon discourages\Nthe prisoners and Luffy becomes the target!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.86,0:23:35.89,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}He's in trouble all by himself!\NIs it all over for him?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.45,0:23:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Brutal Ammunition! The Plague Rounds Aim at Luffy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.43,0:23:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.44,0:23:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:48.44,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
